{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "固定y与对x的偏导数：截线切线斜率",
    "goals": [
      "理解固定y=y₀的几何意义是选取固定截面",
      "掌握在截面内对x求一元导数得到对x的偏导数",
      "理解偏导数是截线在某点的切线斜率，而非直观旋转视角"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "通过三维曲面与y=y₀截面建立几何直觉",
        "推导固定y₀后的截线方程，并投影到二维平面求切线",
        "对比说明特定点偏导数计算过程及其边界条件"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "y0",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "介绍固定y=y₀的几何意义及截面形成",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "上一课我们固定了高度z。这一次，我们要研究求对x的偏导数：这就需要固定输入变量y等于一个常数y₀。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "曲面 z = x² + y² 与截面 y = y₀",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 + y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "固定输入变量",
                "items": [
                  "求对x的偏导数 ➔ 固定y = y₀",
                  "截面垂直于y轴"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "大家看，当y固定时，截面与曲面相交出一条截线。在这个截面内，y保持不变，只有x在变化，高度z随着x变化。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "引导观察截面与曲面的交线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "我把y₀从0平移到1。请注意，平移截面只是在选择我们研究哪条曲线，旋转视角或移动截面本身并不是在求导。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "推导截线方程并展示二维截面内的切线",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我把y₀从0调整到1。请注意，平移截面只是改变了我们选择研究的特定曲线，移动y₀本身绝不等于对x求导。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "当固定y等于1时，原曲面方程转化为一元函数g(x)等于x平方加1。若我们在截面上取x₀等于1，就确定了空间点P(1, 1, 2)。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面内截线与切线关系（纵轴为高度z）",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "z"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                    "label": "截线 z=x²+1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "(2)*(x)",
                    "label": "P处切线 z=2x"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-02"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\quad (y_0 = 1)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦截线与切线图",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "看右侧的二维截面图，此时纵轴代表高度z，横轴代表x。我们可以清晰看到截线z等于x平方加1，以及在x等于1处的切线z等于2x，两者在点(1, 2)完美相切。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-02-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "给出偏导数公式定义与一般性边界反例",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们在二维截面上，对截线方程 $g(x) = x^2 + 1$ 求导，得到 $g'(x) = 2x$。在 $x=1$ 处，导数 $g'(1) = 2$。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x, y_0) - f(x_0, y_0)}{\\Delta x} = 2x_0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "推导截线在 x=1 处的切线斜率",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "结合切点 $(1, 2)$，利用点斜式得到切线方程 $z - 2 = 2(x - 1)$，即 $z = 2x$。请注意，这里的斜率 2 代表高度增量与 $x$ 增量之比，绝非屏幕上肉眼看到的像素倾斜角度。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "明确切线斜率的几何与物理意义",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "写成偏导数的一般形式，在 $(x_0, y_0)$ 处的偏导数为 $f_x(x_0, y_0) = 2x_0$。这里斜率与 $y_0$ 无关，只是 $f(x,y)=x^2+y^2$ 的特殊性质；比如当 $f(x,y)=xy$ 时，偏导数 $f_x = y$ 就与 $y$ 密切相关。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "给出偏导数一般表达并说明结论边界",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "总结截线偏导概念并提出反求y₀的检验问题",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "总结一下：多元函数中固定y等于y零，实质上是将曲面截成一维截线，在该截面上对x求一元导数，其几何意义就是截线在指定点的切线斜率。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-03-moment-01-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "总结固定变量与截线切线斜率的关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "请思考便签上的检查问题：如果在点P(1,1,2)处要求对y的偏导数，我们应该固定哪个变量呢？显然，我们需要固定的是x=1。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "偏导数截面总结与思考",
                "items": [
                  "固定 y = y₀：沿 x 方向变化，求对 x 的偏导数 ∂z/∂x",
                  "固定 x = x₀：沿 y 方向变化，求对 y 的偏导数 ∂z/∂y",
                  "思考：若在 P(1,1,2) 求 ∂z/∂y，应固定 x = 1",
                  "课后验证：固定 x = 1，寻找使 z = 2 的非负 y₀"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "课后请大家完成一个反向验证练习：在固定x=1的前提下，要使曲面上的点高度z等于2，请在非负范围内调节y零的值并观察截面的变化。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-04-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课学习了固定y=y₀截面下的截线，以及其在某点对x的偏导数即为截线切线的斜率。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
      "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
